WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Confucian, we have decided to warn you about your report to the police and fine you two hundred yuan. After paying the fine, you can leave.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,890
What?

3
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,190
Call the police?

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:11,290
Don't you believe me?

5
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:12,890
As long as you go to that convenience store

6
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:16,790
Calm down, I know you are a good citizen who respects tactics, that's why you came to call the police

7
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:21,090
But even if your memory is confused, calling the police is the same as calling the police, and we will deal with it on the basis of circumstances.

8
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:23,090
Maybe if you go back and take a nap, you will wake up a lot.

9
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,090
I just want to ask, have you sent anyone there?

10
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:28,990
After you pay the fine, you can go to the place you mentioned and see for yourself after you go out.

11
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,690
What the hell is going on?

12
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:36,507
This notice sounds like the store manager’s tone

13
00:00:36,507 --> 00:00:39,416
And it’s blood on my hands

14
00:00:39,416 --> 00:00:44,070
Could it be that the store manager is not dead?

15
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,870
Still don’t believe I remembered it wrong

16
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:46,870
Why are you here?

17
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:48,770
I'm a little worried, I followed you here

18
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,870
I took a deep breath at that time, but the store manager was out of breath.

19
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:53,370
The store manager is still alive, so the police will confirm that you reported it to the police

20
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:57,570
People don't necessarily have to be dead to have no breath. It may be that they are in a state of suspended animation, or they may be too nervous.

21
00:00:57,570 --> 00:01:00,170
But surviving is the best outcome for you, isn't it?
